Package: hake-gis
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 qt6-svg-plugins,
 python3-hake-gis (= ${binary:Version}),
 hake-gis-providers (= ${binary:Version}),
 hake-gis-common (= ${source:Version})
Recommends:
 hake-gis-plugin-grass
Suggests: gpsbabel
Replaces: hake-gis-qt6
Description: Geographic Information System (GIS)
 A Geographic Information System (GIS) manages, analyzes, and displays
 databases of geographic information. HAKE-GIS supports shape file viewing and
 editing, spatial data storage with PostgreSQL/PostGIS, projection on-the-fly,
 map composition, and a number of other features via a plugin interface. HAKE-GIS
 also supports display of various georeferenced raster and Digital Elevation
 Model (DEM) formats including GeoTIFF, Arc/Info ASCII Grid, and USGS ASCII
 DEM.

